<title>GERMANY: German labour market should improve in Sept - Jagoda.</title>
<headline>German labour market should improve in Sept - Jagoda.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG, Germany 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>German labour market conditions should show an improvement in September from August, Federal Labour Office President Bernhard Jagoda said.</p>
<p>&quot;I am an optimistic realist,&quot; Jagoda told a news conference. &quot;September is traditionally more favourable than August because all the summer holidays are over. I believe that the September figures will be better than August.&quot;</p>
</text>
